## Project Structure

```
fastapi-docs-assistant/
├── app/                     # Python backend
│   ├── ingest.py            # Scrape, chunk, embed pipeline
│   ├── rag.py               # RAG: rewrite, search, rerank, LLM
│   ├── db.py                # PostgreSQL + pgvector
│   ├── minsearch.py         # TF-IDF search index
│   ├── vector_store.py      # Embedding model
│   └── re_ranker.py         # Cross-encoder reranker
├── scrapers/                # Scrapy spider project
│   └── scrapers/spiders/    # fastapi_docs_spider.py
├── frontend/                # React + Vite chat UI
├── data/                    # Pre-computed datasets
├── notebooks/               # Evaluation scripts
├── grafana/                 # Dashboard provisioning
├── Dockerfile.app           # Multi-stage Python build
├── Dockerfile.frontend      # Multi-stage React build
├── docker-compose.yaml      # 4 services
└── pyproject.toml           # Dependencies
```

